Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.98,0:00:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to die, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All three of you, get away from the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go trying to do anything funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy here is one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you're innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the one that killed\Nthat guard and tried to drown us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's our job to figure\Nout which one of you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,bitches is the imposter\Nor we're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious, Psycho?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you heard me, you dumb bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I recall correctly?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't the Chaka who blew up say\Nsomething about not knowing who you were?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, can you back that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.42,0:00:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember seeing her when\Nwe formed this search party?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:00:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.46,0:01:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't remember who you are either! Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You do know that I was with y\N'all from the jump, don't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.18,0:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to say this, but I\Ncan't say that I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows who your scrawny\Nass is either! Yes you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.26,0:01:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who just called\Nfor help on the radio!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,0:01:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you only did that to trick us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.84,0:01:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.75,0:01:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You there with the black hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.30,0:01:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did your nose just start bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.01,0:01:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't see all that well, but Ermes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.08,0:01:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,when I punched the enemy's stand in the\Nface, one of these three stumbled a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.94,0:01:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.34,0:01:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.26,0:01:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you've got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My nose is bleeding because that bitch\Nhit me in the face when she grabbed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,See, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.65,0:01:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Her bloody hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.66,0:01:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's proof that she did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't hit her, my finger\Njust scraped her teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.74,0:01:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was most definitely here from\Nthe start if anyone's the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.74,0:01:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah Remember what happened when\Nthe chief was chatting with his Cutter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You were over there talking mad shit\NAin't that right little miss bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what the two of you\Nseem pretty suspicious, too
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, so the black hair did do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you\Nfigure out it was her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, to tell the truth, I have\Nno idea if it actually was her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm just gonna\Nknock out all three of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.90,0:02:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.18,0:02:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the fuck do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,D—did she just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my plan's ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to kill you separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.88,0:02:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was gonna get you into the\Nwater and tear you to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.54,0:02:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But your little trick surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I really didn't think you could\Nget out of that situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but that threat power of\Nyours is a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be all three of them, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:02:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.98,0:03:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the actual stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.56,0:03:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand powers are special.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Each individual only gets one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The girls who were actually\Nhere from the very beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.02,0:03:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,were the ones with the black\Nhair and the shaved head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They decided to go near the tractors,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,so I decided to kill them and take\Nover their bodies and intellect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, this body of mine is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You need the body I\Ncreated from the scraps
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,of flesh left over from\Nthe missing prisoners!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to hold my hand. And hold my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to trap and hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.86,0:04:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a survival day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.46,0:04:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.18,0:04:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Life for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a my one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That strange black goop is\Ncoming out of their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My once divided body is now whole again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If it is to protect the\Npower and memory that Pale
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake's discs most\Ngraciously bestowed upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to do anything it takes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,to repay the great debt I owe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my mission to get rid of anyone who\Napproaches the discs in the storehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the fuck is the\Nactual stand user hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:05:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Think again, Ermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:05:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The user is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the thing itself! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.58,0:06:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,See, this thing is a living\Norganism born in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And from the discs, it gained power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.58,0:06:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And the one guarding those discs\Nwas never human to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A living organism?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about all those\Ntiny killer plankton things?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.28,0:06:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the storehouse doesn't\Nhave a constant supply of water,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,it's probably moving by\Nconsuming water from the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,bodies of its victims in\Norder to protect the discs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It exists on land by multiplying itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like gas for a car, it needs to\Nreplenish its water when it runs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to get the disks\Nback from this creature,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.62,0:06:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to make sure it doesn't get close\Nto the water, and then defeat it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if all that crap is true, how can that\Nwalking parasite with a face talk to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I am F .F.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You will call me by my name or not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.90,0:06:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A famous astronomer by the\Nname of Fred Hoyle once said,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It is wrong to assume, even\Nprobabilistically speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,that living organisms were\Nspontaneously born on this Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of intellect was already a\Npre-existing force in this universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and it is that intellect which\Ncreated the origin of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.38,0:07:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,To put it another way, it can be said\Nintellect preceded even the Big Bang,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and that all organisms in matter itself\Nalready possess that intellect. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the actual hell is it\Ngoing on about all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it seeks to prove\Nthat human beings are
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,not the only ones capable\Nof having intellect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.90,0:07:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Even planktons like it can make memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I said my name is FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's painfully obvious I'm\Nmore intelligent than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to hide the disks somewhere\Nnew before we can get to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.62,0:07:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If it manages to bury them\Nunderground, they'll be gone forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.08,0:07:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,J-Jolene, there's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The one that attacked us in\Nthe water earlier is back,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:07:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's trying to grab the guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, the handcuffs!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If we get 50 meters away\Nfrom it, we're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to give up on the discs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our priority should be\Nprotecting the guard's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we get blown up, because I'd\Nrather make it out of this in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, but I'll let\Nyou handle the handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,While I'm running to the storehouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.84,0:08:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it's up to you to protect the guard\Nand haul his body within my safety
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,range so my cop doesn't go off\Nand blow me up before I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.33,0:08:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.14,0:08:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What a crazy bitch. That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would she leave\Nsomething like that up to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, goddammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it pulls the guard's\Nbody into the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,both Jolene and I are going\Nto get blown to kingdom come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no time to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.50,0:09:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah, I managed to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But one thing's for sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,after this bullshit, I ain't ever going\Nto use my stickers like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I actually had\Nto double my arm to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man, I bet it's\Ngonna hurt like a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I just need to carry in within\N50 meters of that stupid storehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, you filthy little maggot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.14,0:09:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a victory, Scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:10:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you've won, don't you, shithead?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the corpse of that poor girl with
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.66,0:10:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the undercut that your\Nother half sucked dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got no moisture left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, thanks to my sticker,\Nshe's been divided into two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All I gotta do is pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That ought to absorb whatever\Nwater is left over like a maxi pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I say it'll dry up like\Na drop of water in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Put a sock in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, the only way we'll\Nwin is if we dry it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to defeat that\Ndisgusting parasite,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got to drain its tank\Nlike it did those girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.92,0:11:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to kill you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You've just made it easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My original plan was to hide the discs
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,somewhere else and then\Nask you some questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, answer me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to step into this puddle\NI've made, or will you run for your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way would you like to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.82,0:11:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're asking questions,\NI've got some too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who the\None behind all this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.54,0:11:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly is Pale Snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, by gathering all the disks together,\Nwhat are they really hoping to achieve?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My, you're an interesting one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.80,0:11:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can understand the motive behind\Nfighting to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Or even fighting to protect your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:12:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not something I can relate\Nto, but I can see why you'd do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.88,0:12:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,However, what I don't understand is why\Nyou'd willingly walk in here to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, as for the one known as Pale Snake,\Nunfortunately, I don't know who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I was\Ndistracted, you moronic child?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.58,0:12:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The entirety of this puddle has\Nalready become a part of my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you trying to soak\Nup the water with flour?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I commend your effort, but you failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.54,0:12:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have full understanding\Nof my power and created
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,an environment for myself\Nwhere I have no weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body seems to be a worthy vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I can live inside of\Nit comfortably for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.80,0:12:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, because now you've already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.58,0:12:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When you made this so-called\Nperfect environment for yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you had to splatter\Nwater all over the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.26,0:13:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,While you were pondering\Nhow to kill me you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't hear me start the\Ntractor with my threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.22,0:13:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the sound of the\Nwater masked the noise
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.74,0:13:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so since you were\Npreoccupied i made my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The tractor has left the storehouse and\Nthe discs you vowed to protect are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.08,0:13:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.12,0:13:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what you have there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Those discs are not yours to take!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.94,0:13:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Soil and Fields is a lot softer\Nthan the area near the wetlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.70,0:13:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The more you run, the more water you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And where you're going,\Nthere ain't no water, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You vile care!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never let you touch the disks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.96,0:14:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems Jolene won this battle of wits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your precious disks no\Nlonger belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dry up and spend the rest of your\Ndays in this field as fertilizer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, what do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving it water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, I'm saving it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This being called FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.18,0:14:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It was never truly protecting the disks\Nbecause it's what Pale Snake wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that clearly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.98,0:14:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it knew its body would slowly\Ndiminish if it ran into the fields,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:14:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it continued chasing the tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it was protecting the Discs as\Na way of protecting its own identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of the power and intellect\Ngiven to it by the Discs,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it put its life on the line\Nout of gratitude for being
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,able to exist in this world\Nas an intelligent lifeform.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Essentially, it doesn't give a damn\Nabout Pale Snake or what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're seriously helping it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It murdered five people\Nwithout a second thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.28,0:15:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And in case you forgot, it\Nliterally isn't even human! Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about what you just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.68,0:15:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not human, it\Nprobably isn't guilty either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who's at fault here is Pale Snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard only passed\Nalong enough information
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,to allow them full control\Nover the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.32,0:15:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, that's not the only\Nreason that I want to help it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say we make a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the Disks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue to do what you've\Nbeen doing this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.74,0:15:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But instead, I want you to do it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,To protect them from Palesnake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:15:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:16:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of trying\Nto steal the Disks from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All I want is to get back the\NDisks that were my father's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.68,0:16:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I want to know every\Ndetail about Palesnake's agenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.62,0:16:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you help us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.42,0:16:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your choice, but there\Nwill be no more killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.98,0:16:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your strange sentiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't quite understand them very well,\Nbut I don't feel like biting anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I've been defeated completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They really are here! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:17:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I finally found the\Ndisc that contains Star Platinum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it rejected me, but it's\Ndefinitely Star Platinum's disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I have this, I can\Nrevive my father, Jotaro Kujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.22,0:17:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.98,0:17:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason I can't find the\None with his memories over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I miss it somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if I were to jump off from that\Nwindow up there, you think I'd die?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.68,0:17:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, no need to get hostile, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.62,0:17:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your new friend, FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to be called\Nthat if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This body was the only usable one,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.18,0:17:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so I replaced her missing parts and snagged\Nthis handcuff off one of the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I took a liking to how it feels, so I\Ndecided to live in this body for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:18:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it appears these fingers\Naren't all that usable anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When you say live in her body,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.88,0:18:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,does that mean you're planning to go\Nback to the prison pretending to be her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.12,0:18:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, my new mission is to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.84,0:18:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have access to all of her memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.34,0:18:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She's Atro, and her\Nprisoner number is FV39423.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.90,0:18:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when she was just a little kid,\Nshe always dreamed of being kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.00,0:18:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, when she grew up, she kidnapped\Na child the way she wanted to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't even do it for\Nransom money or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.26,0:18:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She sort of just did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.14,0:18:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, it looks like both\Nof your arms are bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wish I could\Nheal you, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your tongue off of me, you grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lick us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you, water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you sure ain't human.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.56,0:19:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you go to prison, there\Nare some things you gotta learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say drinking with a cup would\Nbe a pretty good place to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A cup?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.00,0:19:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.22,0:19:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Drinking water out of a cup is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, about what I said earlier, I\Nwant to ask you more about Palesnake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they make a habit of\Ncoming out to this storehouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.47,0:19:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They rarely have ever come near the tractor,\Nand I've never seen the user either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.58,0:19:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The pile of discs here are the\Nones that Palesnake doesn't need.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably know this already, but\Nno matter how strong a stand is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,if you don't have the constitution\Nfor it, it'll reject you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.14,0:19:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why this is the junk pile.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,To them, they're completely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.02,0:19:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The important discs with all the\Nmemories must be stored somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you won't be able to find\Nthe memory disc you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing pale snake wanted to\Nsteal from your father wasn't his
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.92,0:19:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,ultimate stand but most likely it\Nwas the memories inside his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what he has in there but\Nit's got to be a really important?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.98,0:20:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.89,0:20:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The guards are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.72,0:20:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the plan, Jolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.94,0:20:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do with
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum's disc?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, before I can do anything\Nelse, I've gotta figure out how to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.26,0:20:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,get the disc out of this prison and to the\NFoundation that's sheltering my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.02,0:20:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we don't revive him soon, his\Nbody will begin to deteriorate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.71,0:20:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take back His memory\Ndisc no matter what
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it takes you want to get\Nit out of prison huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gonna be a lot harder\Nthan if you were bringing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,something in and when the guards\Nget here they're definitely
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.30,0:20:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna inspect us from head
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.64,0:20:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,to toe get the disc to me all
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.60,0:20:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta do is bump my boobs\Nup a few coat sizes there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:20:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, raise your hands in the air\Nso that they won't shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.54,0:21:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ermes, same for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Our story is that an alligator\Nviciously attacked the guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and it was us who saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we don't know\Nabout the other prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow my lead, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.96,0:21:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She played her role as Baitwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.26,0:21:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro's daughter was\Nonly meant to lure him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.18,0:21:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought she'd become\Nsomeone I'd need to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible she defeated that incompetent\Nguard and took the disc all by herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps these other two\Nprisoners who survived were
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.44,0:21:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,there to lend Jolene a helping\Nhand in thwarting my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, the sun will be setting soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to be getting\Nyou back to the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.12,0:22:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The chief has called off the search.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.66,0:22:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really that worried about\Nprisoners that went missing, Father Pucci?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.14,0:22:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.14,0:22:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I am on the overnight duty\Nuntil I must give the service on Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.10,0:22:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,my head is filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.76,0:22:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place other than here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.48,0:22:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.68,0:22:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,About my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.12,0:23:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Out all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.16,0:23:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,like to do in my life.
